# ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
#  SSH daemon configuration for Azure App Service (custom Linux container)
# ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
# Purpose:
# - Enable SSH access to the container for debugging and maintenance
# - Designed specifically for Azure App Service custom containers
#
# WARNING:
# - This configuration is NOT hardened for general internet exposure
# - SSH should be enabled only when strictly required
# - Protect access using network restrictions (Azure, firewall, private endpoints)
#
# DOCUMENTATION:
# - OpenSSH manual: https://man.openbsd.org/sshd_config
# - Context Azure: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/app-service/configure-custom-container?pivots=container-linux&tabs=debian#enable-ssh
# ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Port 			              2222
ListenAddress 		      0.0.0.0
LoginGraceTime          180
X11Forwarding 	        yes
Ciphers                 aes128-cbc,3des-cbc,aes256-cbc,aes128-ctr,aes192-ctr,aes256-ctr
MACs                    hmac-sha1,hmac-sha1-96
StrictModes 		        yes
SyslogFacility 	        DAEMON
PasswordAuthentication  yes
PermitEmptyPasswords    no
PermitRootLogin 	      yes
Subsystem               sftp internal-sftp
